450	     * detect duplicate owners on create. It is the lower-case hex SHA-256 digest of
451	     * {@code normalizedTelephone + '|' + lowerEmail + '|' + soundex(lastName)} from the owner's
452	     * already-normalized {@code telephone} (E.164 form), its lower-cased {@code email} (empty
453	     * when absent) and the Soundex code of its {@code lastName} (see {@link #soundex}). Two owners
454	     * are duplicates only when their whole {@code identityKey} values are equal.
455	     *
456	     * @return the consolidated identity key
457	     */
